1
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,533
(China Enterprise DataLink)

2
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:08,533
(GangA 96690)

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,919
Ms. Song Huan,

4
00:00:11,919 --> 00:00:12,720
we're here.

5
00:00:16,519 --> 00:00:17,920
You did very well yesterday.

6
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,839
Thank you, Ms. Song Huan.

7
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:26,640
Have we met before?

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,719
I just have one of those faces.

9
00:00:30,039 --> 00:00:31,839
You must have mistaken me
for someone else, Ms. Song Huan.

10
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,920
You're not exactly ordinary-looking.

11
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:39,200
I don't like people who lie to me.

12
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:47,840
In the real world, there are only
two kinds of people.

13
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:50,719
Those who make the rules,
and those who follow them.

14
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:52,560
If you want respect,

15
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,119
you have to be the former.

16
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,719
(Little girl,)

17
00:00:57,439 --> 00:00:59,119
(there are only two kinds of people
in this world.)

18
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,240
(Those who make the rules,
and those who follow them.)

19
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,200
(If you want respect,)

20
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:06,000
(you have to be the former.)

21
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:08,400
All these years,

22
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,640
I've kept your words in mind,
Ms. Song Huan.

23
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:14,000
So it was you.

24
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,319
Back then, you burned your real resume,

25
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:17,799
and now you've made a fake one

26
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,280
to sneak

27
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,319
into the Song family.

28
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,120
Interesting.

29
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,519
All these years,

30
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:27,120
you've always been my idol.

31
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,519
The Midsummer Hotel,

32
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:29,599
the Flying Fish Commercial Hub,

33
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:30,760
and the Sky Cinema.

34
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,159
The Song family is what it is today

35
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:34,200
because you built it up step by step.

36
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:39,159
Every step of the way,

37
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:40,439
I've relied on my own abilities.

38
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,480
With only

39
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,799
what you found online,

40
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,719
you'd never have gotten close to me.

41
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:52,400
So how about this?

42
00:01:54,401 --> 00:01:58,154
(Zhao Hui, General Manager)

43
00:02:00,599 --> 00:02:01,959
You want to betray Zhao Hui?

44
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,159
He was never my ally.

45
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:05,760
I only want to work for you.

46
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,360
What makes me valuable is

47
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,919
=Dear Song=
that I hold nothing back from you.

48
00:02:20,786 --> 00:02:23,240
=Episode 12=
(Reshuffling the Deck)

49
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,199
A fake resume from some back-alley shop

50
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:26,919
falls apart the second anyone looks.

51
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,120
I'll make you a new one.

52
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,719
This card has a million on it.

53
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:35,960
Consider it a reward.

54
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,840
(If I hadn't let you spot the flaw,)

55
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:40,599
(how would you have helped me create)

56
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:43,360
(this perfect resume?)

57
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,319
To keep an eye on the Songs,

58
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,879
you spend an extra 5,000 a month
on rent.

59
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:02,879
Is it worth it?

60
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,199
Keeping your prey where you can see it

61
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,599
is never a bad thing.

62
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,919
Tonight

63
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,400
we can finally sleep easy.

64
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:30,319
But the Songs probably can't.

65
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,919
Song Huan.

66
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:34,919
How dare you touch my man?

67
00:03:34,919 --> 00:03:36,000
I'll scratch your face off!

68
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,120
Are you done making a scene?

69
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:41,120
Zhao Hui is my husband.

70
00:03:41,199 --> 00:03:42,520
As long as I'm part of this family,

71
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,719
no one touches him!

72
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,719
Your husband?

73
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,120
If you can't keep your husband in line,

74
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:49,000
then as your older sister,

75
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,000
I'll do it for you!

76
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,120
What gives you the right?

77
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:53,960
Song Huan,

78
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:56,639
you and I came from the same parents.

79
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:59,319
Other people might not see
how rotten you are inside,

80
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,840
but I sure do!

81
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:03,759
You vicious woman!

82
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,960
You've always hated
seeing anyone do well.

83
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:08,439
You wish every talented person
would just drop dead!

84
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,280
Now it's Zhao Hui.

85
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,520
Back then, it was Song Jing!

86
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,079
Dad.

87
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,519
You hit me?

88
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,519
You've never hit me in my life.

89
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:51,399
And now you hit me because of Song Huan?

90
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:52,639
I hit you

91
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:55,920
because you said things
you shouldn't have.

92
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,000
Dad!

93
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,319
I was wrong this time.

94
00:04:58,319 --> 00:04:59,560
I just lost my head for a moment.

95
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,000
Please, just give me another chance.

96
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,319
I only had the company's
best interests in mind.

97
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,120
Enough!

98
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:07,240
You're all well-regarded.

99
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,160
Aren't you afraid

100
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,920
of the shame if word gets out?

101
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:13,959
Zhao Hui!

102
00:05:14,959 --> 00:05:16,759
You're suspended from every position
you hold at Song Group.

103
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,120
Stay home with Song Lin

104
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,519
and do some serious thinking!

105
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,360
Dad.

106
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,519
That

107
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,120
doesn't seem like enough.

108
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,920
Song Huan,

109
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:38,000
what do you mean by that?

110
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,319
Dad already stripped Zhao Hui
of his duties.

111
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,800
What more do you want?

112
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,519
You've been spoiled for so long

113
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:56,120
you don't even know
the family's rules anymore?

114
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,160
Calling me by my name?

115
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:01,560
Ms. Chen.

116
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,639
Ms. Chen!

117
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:16,199
You nasty old woman!

118
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,319
So you really did team up
with that awful woman!

119
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:54,480
The Song family has always been strict
about background checks

120
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,959
on anyone joining the family.

121
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,720
I'm curious.

122
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,120
How did you even pass?

123
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,160
Honey.

124
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,839
You said you worked at a bar

125
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,439
to pay your way through school.

126
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,720
Wasn't it just a part-time job?

127
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:22,480
Turns out you'd fool around
with just about anyone!

128
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,759
Honey.

129
00:07:25,759 --> 00:07:26,920
I had my reasons.

130
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,199
I can explain everything.

131
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,240
Get out!

132
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,120
You jerk!

133
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,519
Get as far away from me as you can!

134
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,839
I'm divorcing you!

135
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:37,120
I'll have the lawyer
draw up the divorce papers.

136
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:39,920
Divorce him right now.

137
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:42,120
Then get out of the country!

138
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:43,399
Don't come home

139
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:45,120
without my permission!

140
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,759
Mr. Song,

141
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:49,319
Ms. Song Lin is
your favorite daughter, too.

142
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:51,120
You really have the heart
to send her away?

143
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,519
This is Song family business.

144
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,600
Since when do house staff get a say?

145
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,839
Ms. Chen,

146
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,920
you've lined your pockets for years

147
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,160
and stirred up trouble.

148
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,959
You really think I didn't know?

149
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:06,000
You had a hand in this!

150
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:08,519
Mr. Song,

151
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,920
it was Ms. Song Huan...

152
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,839
Ms. Song Huan told me to do it.

153
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,360
I'm just house staff.

154
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,120
I didn't even know

155
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,120
what was in there.

156
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:20,120
You and Zhao Hui are both ungrateful.

157
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,680
Your role as house staff

158
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,639
is to serve the Song children well,

159
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:25,160
not pick sides!

160
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,120
Ms. Song Huan.

161
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:31,319
Please, please put in
a good word for me.

162
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,600
I did all of this for you.

163
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:36,879
Dad's right.

164
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:40,279
You're really not a good fit
for the Song family anymore.

165
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:44,639
What I hate most

166
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,679
is disloyalty.

167
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:51,080
Cheng has an assistant.

168
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,639
She's not bad.

169
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,039
She can take over

170
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:55,320
Ms. Chen's position for now.

171
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:13,919
Really interesting.

172
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:17,039
The Song family's eldest daughter

173
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,919
is really something.

174
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,559
You two.

175
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:27,399
Pack your things

176
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,120
and get out of here right now!

177
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:33,799
Once you're out, watch what you say.

178
00:09:34,279 --> 00:09:35,480
You know that perfectly well.

179
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:40,399
Was getting rid of Ms. Chen

180
00:09:40,399 --> 00:09:41,240
and moving you into her position

181
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,080
part of your plan with Song Huan too?

182
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,080
No.

183
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,399
That

184
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,480
was probably something she gave me

185
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,200
as an extra gift.

186
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,120
Song Huan is very dangerous.

187
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,480
We have no idea what she's going to do.

188
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,399
Ms. Chen served the Song family
for 20 years,

189
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:03,600
and even that personal bond
meant nothing to them.

190
00:10:03,679 --> 00:10:04,639
You and Song Huan have just...

191
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,240
A personal bond

192
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,159
is the last illusion

193
00:10:07,159 --> 00:10:08,519
we can afford right now.

194
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,320
A reshuffle is a good thing.

195
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:14,360
Now, at the table,

196
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:16,039
there are only sharks,

197
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,000
no chumps.

198
00:10:19,919 --> 00:10:20,720
What about Song Cheng?

199
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,600
She doesn't count.

200
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,799
She's with me.
